  "changes": [
    "Fold 後/從/應/須 only in date-detection copies; validate the full literal date boundary. Raw owner/value/quote and Unicode positions remain unchanged.",
    "Support finite same-owner wage receipt after the date, explicitly bounded wage-payment deadlines and explicit wage-payment cutoff dates. No generic payer/recipient interchange, cropped-boundary or another-owner inference.",
    "Exempt a bare monthly/daily/hourly-wage match only when it lies exactly inside the end of the unique literal short owner at the clause heading. No subject-based exemption for actual rate words outside that owner or explicit standards.",
    "Conjunctions inside finite surname/name shapes no longer imply group by themselves. Complete person-fragment coordination, short surname/placeholder coordination and unknown ambiguous short strings remain unresolved; existing owner/period/role gates still apply.",
    "After a real intermediate regression, all terminal 等/等人 remain collective and explicit collective pronouns remain unresolved. Embedded 王等明 is not rejected merely for an internal 等 glyph.",
    "A layout-before numeric monetary-unit tail (元/圆/圓/角/分) directly adjoining a new RMB-cents fragment prevents exact tail extraction. Whitespace/Cf may bridge; punctuation, another owner and ordinary units such as 分钟 do not."
